  "version": "1.9.3",
  "changelog": "Packaging fix only \u2014 the editor's code is identical to 1.9.2. The 1.9.2 installer package itself was built with restrictive file permissions (app files readable only by root's group, the menu entry unreadable, the launcher not executable for a normal user), so on a regular account the Map Editor vanished from the menu and could not start. This package is rebuilt with standard permissions (folders 755, files 644, launcher 755, owner root) and the build now runs a permissions check that fails the package if they are ever wrong again.",
